Portions of this product are copied or adapted from local-rag-mcp
(https://github.com/phamviet86/local-rag-mcp, Apache License 2.0, same author):

- src/gdrive_rag/builder.py, formats.py, xlsx_compat.py, extraction_errors.py,
  models.py: copied, with small trims (markitdown removed).
- src/gdrive_rag/extract.py: PDF, DOCX and XLSX extractors and cell formatting
  adapted from local_rag/extract.py; PPTX, XLS/XLSB, LibreOffice conversion and
  Tesseract OCR (src/gdrive_rag/ocr.py) are new.
- src/gdrive_rag/drive.py: Drive listing, export and error classification adapted
  from local_rag/drive.py.
- src/gdrive_rag/db.py: connection setup and accent folding (fts_fold) adapted
  from local_rag/db.py.
- src/gdrive_rag/chunking.py: window chunking adapted from local_rag/indexer.py.
- src/gdrive_rag/search.py: RRF fusion and numpy vector scoring adapted from
  local_rag/search.py.
- src/gdrive_rag/embeddings.py: OpenAI-compatible client adapted from
  local_rag/embeddings.py.

Third-party software used at run time (not copied into this repository):

- Tesseract OCR 5 and its language data (Apache License 2.0), installed from
  Debian packages and run as a separate program.
- pypdfium2 and the PDFium library it bundles (Apache License 2.0 / BSD-3-Clause),
  installed from PyPI to render scanned PDF pages.
